# Residues at poles and Taylor series at non-analytic points.
residue 1/(z^2+1) at i
residue 1/(z^2+1) at -i
residue 1/z^3 at 0
residue sin(z)/z^2 at 0
residue exp(z)/z at 0
residue 1/(z^2-1) at 1
residue z^2/(z-1)^3 at 1
residue 1/sin(z) at 0
residue exp(1/z) at 0
taylor abs(x) x at 0 order 5
taylor exp(-1/x^2) x at 0 order 6
taylor sqrt(x) x at 0 order 4
taylor log(x) x at 0 order 4
taylor sign(x) x at 0 order 4
